SD value of 0 _._ 2–0 _._ 3 for the sifting procedure is a very rigorous limitation for the
difference between siftings.
Overall, _c_ 1 should contain the finest scale or the shortest period component of the
signal. We can separate _c_ 1 from the rest of the data by


_X_ ( _t_ ) _−_ _c_ 1 = _r_ 1 _._ (5.6)


