_∂x_ [+] _∂y_ [+] _∂z_ [=] _[ −]_ [(] _[σ]_ [ +] _[ b]_ [ + 1)] _[ <]_ [ 0] _[,]_

therefore, the volume of the fluid will eventually tend to zero, suggesting that the
system has an attractor or attractors.
