962 _N._ _E._ _Huang_ _and_ _others_


Figure 48. Comparison between the marginal spectrum and the Fourier spectrum for the R¨ossler
equation: ( _a_ ) the marginal spectrum showing the low-frequency oscillation near 0.1 Hz, and
the high bimodal frequency distribution around 0.2 Hz generated by the intrawave frequency
