Limited by the data length and complicated by the dynamics, all the past investigators have problems in processing this obviously non-stationary data. We have
analysed the data using two methods: the wavelet analysis and the Hilbert spectral
analysis. Although the wavelet results, given in figure 73 show the fluctuation of
